":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":890310502,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw4OTAzMTA1MDI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:import","name":"topic:import","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":2,"created_at":"2025-10-20T00:56:40Z","updated_at":"2025-10-20T15:49:28Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- 4.5.1.stable\n\n### System information\n\nWindows 11 (build 22631)\n\n### Issue description\n\nWe can use the default image viewer of Windows 11 to rotate images 90º. The image looks correctly rotated in every other software I open it in. However, only Godot ignores the rotation.\n\nPhotoshop, browsers, Paint, etc:\n<img width=\"170\" height=\"254\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/014ab2ed-79ce-4bcd-8c72-3e077cf7810e\" />\n\nGodot:\n<img width=\"255\" height=\"173\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/4b9bdc9d-c15d-4a0a-b5e3-856e70743230\" />\n\nI imagine this happens because the image viewer sets some orientation metadata in the file instead of actually rotating pixels, but Godot ignores it.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n- Open any image in the Windows image viewer (I'm not sure what it is called on English systems; maybe Photo Viewer..)\n- `Ctrl + R` to rotate it\n- It doesn't look rotated when used in Godot\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[rotated_image_2025-10-19_21-54-53.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/22993798/rotated_image_2025-10-19_21-54-53.zip)","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111831/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":2},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111831/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}